 "intro_zh": "三峡人家，依山傍水，风情如画。传统的三峡吊脚楼点缀于山水之间，久违的古帆船、乌篷船安静地泊在三峡人家门前，溪边少女挥着棒槌在清洗衣服，江面上悠然的渔家在撒网打鱼，千百年流传的生活习俗孕育了峡江人民独特的风土人情。",
 "intro_en": "Yichang (Chinese: 宜昌), alternatively romanized as Ichang, is a prefecture-level city located in western Hubei province, China. Yichang had a population of 3.92 million people at the 2022 census, making it the third most populous city in Hubei. The city is famous for the Three Gorges, the Three Gorges Dam and the Gezhouba Dam, all three of which are located in Yiling District, one of the city's districts.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
